OL,3,ACarney calls Trump's fresh tariffs a
OL,4,A'miscalculation' after trade talks
OL,5,Acollapse
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe prime minister confirmed he would
OL,8,Fmatch US tariffs "dollar-for-dollar"
OL,9,Ffrom 8 September, including levies on
OL,10,Fsteel, dairy, appliances and
OL,11,Felectronics.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
